{
  "_comment": "Ablation D (combined): trajectory-aware leakage-safe text (include_trajectory_text=true) + all-linear LoRA targets {q,k,v,o,gate,up,down}_proj (r=16). Tests whether stacking the two winning interventions combines their gains -- trajectory text helped Stop (+5.3), capacity helped turns (left +9.8). Same full data + 3 epochs + bs6xaccum3 as the other runs.",
